---
// Multi-Platform Factory Simulation Engine & 3-Tier View Showcase
---

<section id="simulator" class="py-24 bg-pw-card/50 relative border-t border-pw-line">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-pw-green/10 text-pw-green border border-pw-green/20 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
        Browser Diagnostic Engine
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-pw-text tracking-tight">
        Test-Drive Diagnostics Without a Cable.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-pw-muted leading-relaxed">
        Experience real PIWIS diagnostic routines directly in your browser. Our built-in simulation engine runs authentic multi-platform vehicle profiles with live ECU responses, sensor telemetry, and fault isolation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Simulator Interactive Showcase Card -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-pw-panel border border-pw-line shadow-2xl overflow-hidden mb-12">
      <!-- Simulator Top Control Bar -->
      <div class="bg-pw-card border-b border-pw-line px-6 py-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <!-- Platform Selector Pills -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-pw-muted mr-1 hidden sm:inline">PLATFORM:</span>
          <button class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-pw-red text-white text-xs font-mono font-bold shadow-sm">
            986 Boxster S (ME7.2)
          </button>
          <button class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-pw-panel hover:bg-pw-surface text-pw-muted border border-pw-line text-xs font-mono transition-colors">
            996 Carrera (ME7.8)
          </button>
          <button class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-pw-panel hover:bg-pw-surface text-pw-muted border border-pw-line text-xs font-mono transition-colors">
            987.1 Cayman (CAN UDS)
          </button>
          <button class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-pw-panel hover:bg-pw-surface text-pw-muted border border-pw-line text-xs font-mono transition-colors">
            997.1 GT3 (CAN 500k)
          </button>
          <button class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-pw-panel hover:bg-pw-surface text-pw-muted border border-pw-line text-xs font-mono transition-colors">
            Cayenne E1 (KWP2000)
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- 3-State Information Density Segmented Control -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-pw-muted mr-1 hidden lg:inline">VIEW DETAIL:</span>
          <div class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-pw-card border border-pw-line flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-xs">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-surface text-pw-text font-bold shadow-sm">Basic</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 text-pw-muted">Advanced</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 text-pw-muted">Developer</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-green/20 text-pw-green border border-pw-green/30 ml-2">
            SIMULATION ACTIVE
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Simulator Mockup Canvas -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <!-- Left Column: Simulated Module Roster -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-pw-muted border-b border-pw-line pb-2">
            <span>DETECTED CONTROL UNITS (6/6)</span>
            <span class="text-pw-green font-bold">100% HEALTH CHECK</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2.5 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-pw-card border border-pw-line flex items-center justify-between hover:border-pw-muted/40 transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pw-green"></span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-pw-text">DME Motor Electronics</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-pw-muted">Bosch ME7.2 &bull; 0x11</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-green/10 text-pw-green text-[10px] font-bold">0 FAULTS</span>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-pw-card border border-pw-amber/40 bg-pw-amber/5 flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pw-amber"></span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-pw-text">Kombi Instrument Cluster</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-pw-muted">Siemens VDO K24 &bull; 0x64</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-amber/20 text-pw-amber text-[10px] font-bold">1 NOTICE</span>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-pw-card border border-pw-line flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pw-green"></span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-pw-text">ABS / PSM 5.7</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-pw-muted">Bosch 0 273 004 541 &bull; 0x1F</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-green/10 text-pw-green text-[10px] font-bold">0 FAULTS</span>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-pw-card border border-pw-line flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pw-green"></span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-pw-text">Alarm / Immobilizer</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-pw-muted">Megamos M534 &bull; 0xC0</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-green/10 text-pw-green text-[10px] font-bold">0 FAULTS</span>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-pw-card border border-pw-line flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pw-green"></span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-pw-text">Airbag POSIP</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-pw-muted">TRW AB01 &bull; 0x57</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-green/10 text-pw-green text-[10px] font-bold">0 FAULTS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: 3-Tier Detail View Comparison -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-pw-muted border-b border-pw-line pb-2">
            <span>INFORMATION DENSITY SELECTOR</span>
            <span class="text-pw-red font-bold">DYNAMIC ADAPTATION</span>
          </div>

          <!-- 3 Interactive Cards Demonstrating the View Tiers -->
          <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
            <!-- Tier 1: Basic View -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-pw-card border border-pw-line space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-panel border border-pw-line text-[11px] text-pw-green font-bold">
                  [1] BASIC VIEW &bull; DIY OWNER MODE
                </span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-pw-muted">Plain English / German</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm font-sans font-medium text-pw-text leading-normal">
                &ldquo;Instrument cluster indicates high-mileage donor swap lock. Vehicle authentic VIN is verified and ready for migration.&rdquo;
              </p>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-pw-muted font-sans">
                Explains vehicle health in clear language so any enthusiast can diagnose problems without deciphering hexadecimal codes.
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tier 2: Advanced View -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-pw-card border border-pw-line space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-panel border border-pw-line text-[11px] text-pw-amber font-bold">
                  [2] ADVANCED VIEW &bull; WORKSHOP TECHNICIAN
                </span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-pw-muted">Factory PIWIS Descriptors</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs text-pw-text space-y-1">
                <div><strong>K-Zahl Speedo Impulse:</strong> 4,380 Imp/km (Factory: 4,710 &bull; uk_1to1 Verified)</div>
                <div><strong>Coolant Sensor:</strong> 88.4°C Unbuffered | Needle Center Deadband: Active</div>
                <div><strong>Freeze Frame:</strong> 2,840 RPM | 13.84 V | 44% Load | Closed Loop Lambda</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tier 3: Developer View -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-pw-card border border-pw-line space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-pw-panel border border-pw-line text-[11px] text-pw-red font-bold">
                  [3] DEVELOPER VIEW &bull; REVERSE ENGINEERING
                </span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-pw-muted">Raw ISO 14230 Byte Frames</span>
              </div>
              <pre class="text-[11px] text-pw-muted overflow-x-auto py-1 font-mono">
TX &gt;&gt; 83 11 F1 23 38 38 00 20 (READ_XRAM ST 95040 SPI EEPROM)
RX &lt;&lt; A3 F1 11 63 57 50 30 5A 5A 5A 39 38 5A 31 53 36 34 ... [OK]
BUS: K-Line Pin 7 | P2_MAX: 50ms | SHA-256 Checksum: MATCH</pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Simulator Highlight Feature Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-xs text-pw-muted">
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-pw-panel border border-pw-line space-y-2">
        <div class="text-pw-text font-bold font-mono text-sm">Authentic PIWIS Fixtures</div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Simulated diagnostic frames are captured directly from real PIWIS hardware sessions across 986, 996, 987, and Cayenne control units.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-pw-panel border border-pw-line space-y-2">
        <div class="text-pw-text font-bold font-mono text-sm">Synchronized Bilingual Engine</div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          One-click instant toggle between official Porsche factory English and authentic Stuttgart German engineering terms (Zündaussetzer, Steuergerät, Lambdasonde).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-pw-panel border border-pw-line space-y-2">
        <div class="text-pw-text font-bold font-mono text-sm">Zero-Risk Safe Exploration</div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Safely test procedures, inspect coding blocks, and evaluate donor cluster migration workflows without connecting to a vehicle.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
